      mechanicalEffect: 'DC 13 Command roll to hold the line on full remediation today (offering a 90-minute fast-track for the 8 specific hosts instead of an exception). Failure: the 8 hosts are exempted; they continue beaconing through the weekend behind the C2 block, generating EDR-alert noise that has to be triaged off-hours and degrading the team\'s posture across Saturday and Sunday.',
