      mechanicalEffect: 'DC 12 Analysis roll to confirm the secondary domain is a real backup C2 (not noise), add it to the perimeter block in the same wave as the primary, and notify the vendor of the new IOC so they can update their advisory. Failure: the secondary C2 stays unblocked until act 3 verification; one host completes a second-stage callback before remediation finishes (no payload received because remediation lands in time, but a real close call).',
