  failureCondition:
    'Conclude "EDR caught it, we are fine" without reconstructing the failure mode (the actor retries successfully on a different host 6 hours later), miss a persistence mechanism the actor planted before the failed detonation (re-beacon at the next reboot), or close the incident without checking for a second dropper on other hosts.',
