      mechanicalEffect: 'DC 11 Command roll to give Marsha a clean answer: "3 files — salary bands, executive compensation, and Q1 PII audit with 240 employee records; the privacy counsel is reviewing notification obligations and will have an answer by EOD; the SOC will have a clean written incident summary by 09:00 tomorrow; in the meantime, please don\'t communicate to employees yet because the investigation is still moving." Failure: the SOC over-shares (Marsha calls a meeting with HR leadership and someone leaks to employees prematurely) OR under-shares (Marsha escalates to the CEO with "the SOC won\'t tell me anything"). Either failure damages cross-team trust at a delicate moment.',
