      mechanicalEffect: 'DC 10 Command roll to engage Jamal productively — quick 15-minute call to exchange IOC packets, defer the detailed campaign-write-up cross-reference until Act 3, and add the 6 additional domains to the current investigation\'s scope right away. Failure: the team either drops Jamal\'s outreach to focus on the active work (missing 6 high-value IOCs and losing a chance to broaden the takedown request), OR the team spends 90 minutes in Jamal\'s detailed campaign-history briefing while the active containment work slows — costing the timely Cloudflare submission window.',
