      mechanicalEffect: 'DC 9 Command roll to engage Marcus respectfully — acknowledge the time pressure he was under, walk him through the IAM-role path (which is already in use by the vendor) and demonstrate that closing public access will NOT break the audit-firm workflow, and get his buy-in for the immediate lockdown. Failure: Marcus escalates to the Finance VP, who initially backs him ("the SOC is breaking my audit"), and the lockdown is delayed by one round while the SOC re-negotiates politically — during which the bucket remains world-readable.',
