      mechanicalEffect: 'DC 9 Command roll to coordinate with Comms/PR — give them a factual one-paragraph summary (what was exposed, what was confirmed accessed, what was done) and let them handle the press response, rather than trying to short-circuit the legal review for speed. Failure adds reputational_pressure complication: a rushed Legal finding ships without the residential-IP anomaly properly contextualized, and a correction has to be issued the next day.',
