      mechanicalEffect: 'DC 10 Vigilance + Command roll to (a) preserve the BEFORE state of the marcus-t-dev profile (the SOC already screenshotted it in act 1 — good), (b) preserve the AFTER state now, (c) investigate whether there was a leak (Anita talking to Marcus? a help-desk ticket that crossed paths? a colleague who heard a rumor?), and (d) brief the committee on the cleanup activity as additional evidence (it implies awareness, which strengthens the Legal case). Failure: the team treats the cleanup as just a noise data-point, fails to preserve the BEFORE/AFTER comparison, and Legal\'s civil case loses one of its strongest "consciousness of guilt" indicators.',
