      mechanicalEffect: 'DC 10 Command roll to give the CISO the calibrated answer (the dependency on Goldsmith\'s response, the two scenarios + their implications, the SOC\'s role being containment + facts rather than deal-close-decision-making) without conveying false confidence or unnecessary alarm. Failure: the SOC over-promises ("the deal will close on time") and one of the two scenarios materializes against that promise, OR under-promises ("the deal will probably be delayed") and creates panic that did not need to happen.',
